# Expected outcome

- The kick-restart loop repeatedly re-optimizes from small perturbations of the incumbent, which previously lifted `min_area_normalized` from ~0.02 to ~0.033 (combined ≈ 0.89).
- Larger budget (150s seeds + kicks up to 300s + polish to 340s) stays safely under the 360s limit while giving the stochastic search room to find better basins.
- All randomness remains fixed-seed, so results are deterministic; exception handling and the graceful fallback are preserved.
